Spring DATA JPA(Java Persistance API)

Spring Data JPA is a module of Spring the eliminates boilerPlateDAO code and lets you to interact with databases using JPA and repository abstractions.
You just have to write interfaces and spring does the rest

Advantages 
1. Database Independence
2. Massive reduction of boilerplate code
3. Repository abstractions
4. Easy integration with Spring  boot
5. Automatic Transaction management
6. Powerful query methods
7. JPQL and native query
8. 	Built in pagination and sorting

